#. y4:msg_branch_choice=You're pretty careful about things.
msgctxt "5156_Maya"
msgid "I know, right? The cameras at work are super high def, so if my skin is even a little off, it'll totally pick up on it!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
